WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.290
Possible evidence comes
from an FBI raid on an

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:06.830
Arizona warehouse in
January 2014.

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:12.020
Inside, agents discover
buckets of limbs and a

00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:15.830
female head sewn onto
another body destined for

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:17.930
sale to the US military.

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:21.940
The FBI files on this
investigation have been

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:25.240
sealed, so there's no
real way to know which

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:28.450
bodies ended up at which
military bases and what

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:30.250
kind of tests they were
subjected to.

00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:35.120
Human experimentation at
the base and the image

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:36.770
began decades ago.

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:41.190
A lot of work is
classified, but some

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:43.650
programs like Operation
Delirium, where US

00:00:43.650 --> 00:00:48.420
soldiers were dosed with
PCP, sarin gas, just to

00:00:48.420 --> 00:00:51.210
test the effects. Those
types of drills were

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:52.230
conducted at this
location.

